	<section id="about">
    <div class="main p-0">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="aboutBox animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
                    <h1>Celebrating two decades of <span id="rotating-words" class="words"></span></h1>
                    <p>At CSC, we are driven by a deep passion for sound, meticulously designing professional audio systems that deliver high performance and reliability. Trusted by AV integrators, audio engineers, and consultants across India, UK, and Europe, our German design team thrives on innovation — creating pro audio equipment tailored for mission-critical venues and diverse commercial sound systems. From concept and prototyping to thorough testing, our commitment to precision has led to groundbreaking innovations, including patented designs like the market's shallowest double 18" subwoofer — a true reflection of our dedication to engineering excellence in professional audio.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
    window.welcomeWords = ["Excellence.","Creativity.","Trust.","Passion.","Performance."];
</script>
